  description: Constructed from the remains of numerous creatures and bound together
    through advanced necromancy, Skeleton Golems represent a grotesque union of Death
    magic and construct engineering. Unlike lesser undead, their creation demands
    considerable mastery and vast quantities of Mana. Their existence is widely regarded
    as a desecration of the natural order.
